{"aquupaq": [{"body": "这里的几个判断函数是不是能够合并一下，统一到agent_hint中", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/737#tid-184871349", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}], "coopermassaki": [], "dongyupeng": [{"body": ">https://quay.io/repository/ascend/vllm-omni?tab=tags\n>vllm-omni已出0.26.0的镜像，下载A2适配的镜像 docker pull quay.io/ascend/vllm-omni:v0.26.0\n>A2-64G的部署方式和A2是一样的，A2-32G可能还需要叠加hsdp或者采用分布式layerwise降显存占用\n\n[@changetheway](https://gitcode.com/changetheway) \n\n想问下hsdp怎么用呢", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/286#tid-184781497", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}], "kexiongyu": [], "linman520": [{"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/243#tid-183011775", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/244#tid-183011774", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/246#tid-183011766", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/245#tid-183011770", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/247#tid-183011762", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/248#tid-183011760", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/249#tid-183011758", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/250#tid-183011755", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/251#tid-183011756", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/251#tid-183011753", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://