m/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/273#tid-183011696", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/275#tid-183011691", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/276#tid-183011687", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/278#tid-183011682", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/277#tid-183011684", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/279#tid-183011678", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/280#tid-183011674", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/281#tid-183011672", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/282#tid-183011671", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/140#tid-182837904", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "我要认领这个任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/102#tid-182837905", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}], "luoshu07": [{"body": "认领该任务\n", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/282#tid-183660932", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}], "m0_66826439": [{"body": ">> ⚠️ **系统补救通知**: 因仓库 Webhook 未配置导致遗漏，该 PR 创建时未被自动审计。现补充审计结果如下。\n>\n><div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n>🔍 PR 规范审计未通过，以下项目需要修正：\n>\n>- ⚠️ <span style=\"color: #cc0000; font-weight: bold;\">PR 代码变更未包含测试用例（变更文件路径中均不包含 test 或 ut），请确认已经备注原因！</span>\n>\n>请修正后重新提交，或联系仓库管理员。\n>\n></div>\n\n[@xiangjie10](https://gitcode.com/xiangjie10) \n\n收到我正在处理", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/merge_requests/441#tid-183678006", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}], "onion-111": [{"body": "候补该任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/245#tid-185409645", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "候补认领该任务\n", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/243#tid-185408775", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "候补认领该任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/255#tid-185407269", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "候补认领该任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/254#tid-185407229", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "候补认领该任务", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/249#tid-184350094", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}], "qq_44253443": [{"body": "我觉得可以添加nfs和hostpath的使用示例。在具体实践中，客户通常会通过DME来统一为所有计算节点挂载同一文件系统。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/714#tid-184492740", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}], "seunjjs": [{"body": "是不是你这只有4个卡，但是启动写了8？", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/issues/311#tid-186577005", "type": "issue_comment", "invalid": 0}], "weixin_42200347": [{"body": "问题：_check_node_managers_status 遇到第一个 abnormal 的 NodeManager 就立即 return True, reachable_nms，此时 reachable_nms 只包含之前检查过的 NodeManager。如果异常 NodeManager 排在前面，返回的\n  reachable 列表可能为空或不全，导致 _dispatch_partial_loss_shutdown 漏发 shutdown。\n建议：先遍历全部 NodeManager，收集所有可达的，再统一返回 (has_abnormal, reachable_nms)。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/710#tid-184653326", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "如果 _generate_client_args 或 SafeHTTPSClient 构造失败，client 未定义，finally 中 client.close() 会抛出 UnboundLocalError，掩盖原始异常。\n\n建议：将 client = SafeHTTPSClient(...) 提前到 try 之前，或初始化 client = None 并在 finally 中判断。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/710#tid-184649180", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：asyncio.run() 会创建并关闭新事件循环，且不能嵌套调用，也不能在已有事件循环的线程中调用。若某个 module 的 stop() 是 async，且当前线程已有事件循环（例如 Coordinator的某些组件、测试事件循环、或被 async 上下文调用时），会抛出 RuntimeError。更严重的是，每个 async stop 都独立 asyncio.run，无法共享 loop。\n\n建议：改为 loop = asyncio.new_event_loop(); loop.run_until_complete(coro); loop.close()，或一次性收集所有 async stop 后统一 asyncio.run(asyncio.gather(*coros))。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/710#tid-184644328", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：本次 PR 在 SKILL.md 中新增规则：“Never write one-off verification results — benchmark performance numbers... into skill references”，但同一份 PR 在 config_reference.md\n  中仍然写入了具体性能数字：\n\n  ▎ “1M+ 长上下文查询下，请求体积缩减约 55%，端到端查询耗时……约为 JSON 的 1/4（5M 上下文约 42ms vs 220ms）”\n\n  这直接违反了刚添加的 skill 规则。\n\n  修改方案：二选一：\n  - 若坚持 skill 规则，则把 config_reference.md 中的具体数值改为定性描述，或移到 PR 描述/ISSUE/用户案例文档；\n  - 若认为用户配置参考文档例外，则应在 SKILL.md 规则中明确例外范围。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/687#tid-183836712", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：函数 docstring 写明 \"Returns fallback when response is None\"，但实际实现直接返回 \"\"，与文档声明不符", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/687#tid-183836037", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "  问题：window_sec 在 __init__ 中从 config 读取一次，之后即使 kv_affinity.stats_window_sec 通过热重载变更，聚合器仍使用旧值。\n  后果：运维调整窗口大小或关闭统计后，必须重启 Coordinator 才能生效。\n  建议：在 record() 中读取当前配置，或提供 update_window_sec() 方法供热重载路径调用。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/681#tid-183774289", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "可以包一下吗？这个数据太长了，维护性较差", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/681#tid-183773662", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：_SchedulerRequestDispatcher.__init__ 中创建了 KvAffinityPredictionAggregator，并提供了 flush() 方法，但 并没有在 Scheduler进程关闭/退出路径中调用 flush()。\n后果：Scheduler 重启时，最后一个时间窗口的采样会丢失，导致该窗口的 predicted-hit 数据不完整。\n 建议：在 _SchedulerRequestDispatcher 的停止/清理方法（或 AsyncSchedulerServer 的 shutdown）中调用 self._kv_affinity_stats.flush()。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/681#tid-183764464", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：大量参考文档给出精确到行的文件大小和行号引用（如 instance_manager.py:906、controller.py:257）。虽然当前匹配，但代码稍有改动就会失效。SKILL.md 虽有 \"Skill Sync\" 规则要求同步更新，但完全依赖人工维护，长期可靠性差。\n\n建议： 在关键文件表中去掉精确行号，仅保留文件路径；正文中的 :行号 引用改为函数/类名引用（如 InstanceManager._handle_inactive() 而非 instance_manager.py:660-683）。SKILL.md 的 \"Skill Sync\"\n  规则已要求同步，应让它同步名称而非行号", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/395#tid-183098473", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "将 ISSUE 草稿写入 docs/issue_drafts/<YYYY-MM-DD>-<short-title>.md，但仓库中不存在该目录，首次执行会失败。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/395#tid-183097262", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "这里说称已通过在 Workload.__iadd__ 中增加 max(0, ...) 下限保护来修复负数 workload 问题，但当前 motor/common/resources/endpoint.py: 的 __iadd__ 实现没有任何下限保护。这会让未来阅读 skill 的 agent 误以为 bug 已修复，从而跳过必要的修复。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/395#tid-183095976", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "不符合项目通常的 import 风格，应移到文件顶部。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/658#tid-182891710", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "当未指定 --hardware-type 但传了 deploy 覆盖时，hybrid_pod_npu_num 使用 dp * tp，若 pp > 1 会低估实际 NPU 需求。应改为 dp * tp * pp。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/658#tid-182891412", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：该检查只能发现“已注册的 node manager 中有人没 endpoint”。如果 nnodes=2 但只注册了 1 个 node manager（且该节点有 endpoint），则 sent == len(node_managers)，检查通过，但实际跨节点实例仍不完整。\n\n 修改建议：增加 if nnodes > 1 and len(node_managers) < nnodes: return False 的前置校验，或确保调用方已完成数量校验。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/658#tid-182889249", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：当通过 cli_tokens_to_engine_config() 等入口直接调用 cli_args_to_engine_config() 时，infer_parallel=True 会默认从 kv_connector_extra_config 提取 dp/tp（不含 pp），导致 parallel 中没有\n  prefill_pp/decode_pp，从而把用户 CLI 中的 --pipeline-parallel-size 覆盖为 1。\n  \n  建议：在 cli_args_to_engine_config 中推断 parallel 时，同步从 CLI 读取 pp 并填入 parallel；或把 pp 作为独立参数传入 apply_engine_parallel，当 parallel 中无 pp 时回退读取 cli_args 中的\n  pipeline-parallel-size，而不是直接写 1。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/658#tid-182887284", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "位置：\n    - motor/config/endpoint.py\n    - motor/config/node_manager.py\n    - motor/engine_server/core/vllm/vllm_config.py\n  - 问题：三处代码都校验 kv_connector_extra_config.connectors 必须是长度 ≥2 的 dict 列表，逻辑几乎相同。后续新增 connector 类型或校验规则时容易遗漏某一处。\n  - 建议：抽取公共校验函数到 motor/common/constants.py 或 motor/config/config_utils.py，三处统一调用。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/650#tid-182759089", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：hostpath 允许用户将节点任意目录挂载进容器。虽然 README 已警告“纯本地目录会静默造成跨节点前缀缓存零命中”，但未限制危险路径（如 /etc, /proc, /var/run/docker.sock 等）。\n\n建议：\n1. 增加危险路径黑名单或路径前缀白名单校验；\n2. 或至少要求 read_only: true 才能使用 hostpath；", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/650#tid-182758693", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：_validate_ucm_storage_backends 用 posixpath.normpath() 规范化 backend 路径，但 mount_paths 集合直接取 _entry_mount_path() 的原始值。若用户写 mount_path: \"/mnt/ucm/\" 而 backend 写\n  \"/mnt/ucm\"，会误判为不匹配。\n  \n  建议：mount_paths 生成时也使用 posixpath.normpath()，保持两边比较口径一致。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/650#tid-182758216", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "问题：注释说明“standalone UCMConnector is only supported in the union role or as connectors[1] of a MultiConnector”，但代码对 kv_connector == UCMConnector 无条件抛 ValueError，未判断当前\n  role。如果 union role 期望支持 standalone UCM，则此实现会直接阻断。\n  \n建议：要么按注释补全 role 判断（union 放行、prefill/decode 拒绝），要么修正注释，确保行为与文档一致。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/650#tid-182757505", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}], "wenjiali_sh": [{"body": "/lgtm", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/merge_requests/535#tid-186683897", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 1}, {"body": "test_preserves_failed_command_exit_code 中的 bash -c 'exit 7' 位于脚本末尾，实际不会进入 mindiesd_report_build_error，因此新增 UT 已失败，也说明末尾构建命令失败时无法输出本 PR 期望的定位信息。请调整实现或测试策略，确保最后一条命令失败也能产生诊断，并在 CI 环境执行该 UT 验证。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/merge_requests/437#tid-186647620", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "这里直接调用 `func.forward(*args, **kwargs)`，绕过了 `nn.Module.__call__`。\n原有的 `func(*args, **kwargs)` 会保留模块自定义的 __call__ 逻辑；当前实现\n在模块注册任意 hook 后会进入手动 hook 路径，因此即使缓存未命中、仍执行真实\nforward，也可能跳过模型的后处理、执行上下文或分发逻辑，造成启用缓存前后结果不一致。\n\n请保留正常的模块调用语义，或对重写 __call__ 的模块显式降级/拒绝该手动 hook\n路径；同时补充“自定义 __call__ + forward hook”的回归测试。", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/merge_requests/543#tid-186634314", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "/lgtm", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-SD/merge_requests/544#tid-186514545", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 1}], "wenkea": [{"body": "compile", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184894403", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "compile", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184893880", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "retry", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184893409", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "retry", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184886383", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "compile", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184886129", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "compile\n", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184871473", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "retry", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184852536", "type": "pr_comment", "invalid": 0}, {"body": "compile", "url": "https://gitcode.com/Ascend/MindIE-Motor/merge_requests/651#tid-184